<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the output voltage of oxygen sensor voltage B1S2 on the data monitor screen. If the output voltage of oxygen sensor voltage B1S2 is 0.1V or less, the oxygen sensor voltage B1S2 circuit may be open.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The oxygen sensor output voltage and air-fuel ratio feedback (air-fuel ratio F/B value) status can be read using SST (TaSCAN).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Using the [Diagnosis Judgment Result Check] function of SST (TaSCAN), the DTC judgment can be confirmed by performing the oxygen sensor output voltage inspection procedure below. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000014C700DX_07" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007II00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, switch from normal mode to check mode. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)[●1]</ptxt>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>Start the engine and allow it to idle for 60 seconds or more. [●2]</ptxt>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>Drive the vehicle at 40km or more for 40 seconds or more. [●3]</ptxt>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>Allow the engine to idle for 10 seconds or more. [●4]</ptxt>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>Perform steps [●3] to [●4] 10 times. [●5]</ptxt>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>Inspect the output voltage of O2 sensor circuit B1S2.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>If this test is not performed properly, accurate malfunction detection will not be possible.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If there is a malfunction, the check engine warning light will illuminate while performing step [●5].</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Using the [Diagnosis Judgment Result Check] function of SST (TaSCAN), the DTC judgment can be confirmed by performing the oxygen sensor output voltage inspection procedure. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A095232J05" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</step1>
</content5>
</subpara>
