<test1>
<ptxt>Intake Air Amount Inspection</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Park the vehicle on a level surface and inspect with the engine stopped.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not extract exhaust from the exhaust tail pipe with an exhaust duct.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<test2>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and wait for 30 seconds.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, select [ECU Data Monitor] - [Intake Air Volume] and read the intake air volume.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>0.48g/s or less</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
